#org @gText_CapeBrink_DH0
[RED]Hello[.] I am able to teach a\nvery powerful forbidden move.\pIt's called [GREEN]Dark Hole.\n[RED]I'm sure you're familiar with it.\pI can teach it only once, but[.]\pYou'll have to best me in battle.\pWill you entertain me?

#org @gText_CapeBrinkDH0_1
Very well, let us begin.

#org @gText_CapeBrink_DHNoBattle
