#org @gText_DHTutor_Defeat
Heh, forbidden but still very\nflawed[.]

#org @gText_CapeBrinkDH0_2
It feels silly, spending years\nlearning this prohibited technique, yet\lbeing such a powerless trainer.\pBut, I don't mean to detract from\nyour abilities. You are clearly\lvery skilled.

#org @gText_CapeBrink_DH1
Would you like me to teach [GREEN]Dark Hole?\n[RED]This can only be taught once.

